<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #E8E8E8; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
  <strong>{{fromUserEmail}}</strong> has offered to transfer ownership of
  <strong>{{accountName}}</strong> to you. Until you accept, nothing
  changes — the current owner still has full control.
</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #E8E8E8; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
  Accepting promotes you to <strong>owner</strong> and demotes the
  current owner to <strong>admin</strong>. The swap is atomic; you'll
  see the new role on your next page load.
</p>

<table
  role="presentation"
  cellspacing="0"
  cellpadding="0"
  border="0"
  width="100%"
>
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding: 8px 0 24px;">
      <a
        href="{{acceptUrl}}"
        style="display: inline-block; background-color: #15803d; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.2px;"
      >
        Review transfer offer
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 24px 0 0; color: #808080; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
  This offer expires on {{expiresAt}}. If you weren't expecting it,
  ignore this email — nothing happens unless you click the link
  above. The current owner can also cancel the offer at any time.
</p>
